ma: diagnostic and therapeutic aspects</article-title><source>Cancer Lett</source><year>2005</year><volume>228</volume><fpage>283</fpage><lpage>299</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Cancer Lett||228|283||bib8|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15975710</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>De Bernardi</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Conte</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Mancini</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Donfrancesco</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Alvisi</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Tom&#x000e0;</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Casale</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Cordero di Montezemolo</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Cornelli</surname><given-names>PE</given-names></name><name><surname>Carli</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Localised resectable neuroblastoma: results of the second study of the Italian Cooperative Group for Neuroblastoma</article-title><source>J Clin Oncol</source><year>1995</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>884</fpage><lpage>893</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Clin Oncol||13|884||bib9|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7707115</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>De Bernardi</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Nicolas</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Boni</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Indolfi</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Carli</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Cordero di Montezemolo</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Donfrancesco</surname><given-names>A</